---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PricingCalculator from '../components/PricingCalculator.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Enterprise Engagement Models & Pre-Sales Implementation | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Structured B2B engagement models for EU Battery Passport compliance: Managed Sovereign Cloud Subscription vs Turnkey On-Premise Enterprise Suite. Transparent 4-step onboarding journey."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">Commercial & Deployment Architecture</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Enterprise Engagement Models <br />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">& 4-Step Implementation Roadmap</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Every battery manufacturer has unique production lines, ERP architectures, and export timelines. We provide two flexible delivery models tailored to your data sovereignty and budgetary requirements.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Dual Commercial Models Comparison Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Model 1: Managed Sovereign Cloud Subscription -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between border-t-4 border-cyan-600 relative">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
            Model A · Turnkey Cloud
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
            Managed Sovereign Cloud Subscription
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
            Ideal for battery manufacturers and Tier-1 pack suppliers requiring rapid European market entry with zero overseas infrastructure overhead.
          </p>

          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 mb-6 space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Standard Scope & Deliverables:</div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>10-Year Sovereign Data Vault:</strong> Frankfurt Tier-IV ISO 27001 data center with 99.9% uptime SLA.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Rolling Regulatory Patches:</strong> Continuous automatic schema updates matching EU Delegated Acts.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Zero-Knowledge Privacy:</strong> Shield proprietary chemical BOM and purchasing costs.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>GS1 Digital Link 2D Resolution:</strong> High-speed worldwide DNS resolution & eIDAS 2.0 digital seals.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4 pb-4 border-t border-slate-200">
            Commercial Structure: <strong>Annual Cloud Subscription + Model Ingestion</strong>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/contact/?pref=subscription"
            class="neo-btn-primary block w-full text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold"
          >
            <span>Request Subscription Proposal →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Model 2: Enterprise On-Premise Turnkey Suite -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between border-t-4 border-slate-800 relative">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
            Model B · Private Deployment
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
            Enterprise On-Premise Turnkey Suite
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
            Designed for high-volume gigafactories and automotive OEMs requiring complete data residency within their own private cloud or corporate datacenter.
          </p>

          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 mb-6 space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Standard Scope & Deliverables:</div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Perpetual / Enterprise Software License:</strong> Full source connector & compliance engine deployment.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Deep Factory Integration:</strong> Read-only connectors to plant MES, ERP (SAP/Oracle), and BMS.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Data Cleansing & Initialization:</strong> Expert engineers map historical BOM into standard 90+ fields.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Staff Training & Commissioning:</strong> On-site operational training, acceptance testing, and audit support.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4 pb-4 border-t border-slate-200">
            Commercial Structure: <strong>Software License + Deployment & Integration Fee</strong>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/contact/?pref=onprem"
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white block w-full text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold shadow-md transition-all hover:scale-[1.01]"
          >
            <span>Request Private Cloud Scoping →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 4-Step Pre-Sales & Onboarding Journey -->
    <div class="mb-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-2">Frictionless Pre-Sales Process</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          4-Step Onboarding Journey to Regulatory Readiness
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2">
          From initial data discovery to live EU DG GROW Registry verification, we provide a guided, risk-free onboarding pathway.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="neo-surface p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              01
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Compliance Gap Audit</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Review current BOM, supplier data availability, and LCA carbon records against the 90+ EU Annex XIII mandatory attributes.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-800">
            Timeline: Week 1–2
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="neo-surface p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              02
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Architecture Scoping</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Determine deployment preference (Managed Cloud vs On-Premise) and define read-only connector boundaries to plant MES/ERP.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-800">
            Timeline: Week 3
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="neo-surface p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              03
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Clean Room Mapping</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Execute data cleansing in a secure domestic clean room, generate ZKP privacy proofs, and configure Frankfurt sandbox nodes.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-800">
            Timeline: Week 4–6
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="neo-surface p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-800 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              04
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Registry & Laser Test</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Pre-validate UPI with EU DG GROW Registry, issue eIDAS 2.0 digital seals, and complete factory 2D laser marking verifications.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-green-800">
            Timeline: Production Ready
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Architecture & Scoping Configurator Section -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-2">Pre-Sales Self-Service Tool</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Interactive Architecture & Scoping Configurator
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2">
          Select your factory parameters below to generate a tailored technical scope breakdown and request a formal project proposal.
        </p>
      </div>

      <PricingCalculator />
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
